# Project context

- Decentraland SDK7 reference lives under `/dclcontext` and via `cursor.config`.
- **UI Component Kit:** before creating or editing any `Layer` / zone UI, read and follow `.cursor/skills/ui-component-kit/SKILL.md`.
- Hard rules: one Layer = one Zone; implement `body()` only; forward size/align through `uiTransform` and `uiBackground` only — never Layer shorthands (`backgroundColor`, `borderRadius`, `showFrame`, …); panel chrome via `<Background>` in `body()`; do not re-mount `ScreenInsetArea`/`ZoneRoot`/`Zone` in `render()`.
- **Widths:** on `Row` / `Column` / `Label` / `ButtonText`, use **`cols`** for fractional/full width (`cols={12}` = full). Do **not** use `width: '100%'` / `'50%'` / … when a span will do — even if an older demo still does.
- **Imports:** always relative (`./`, `../`) under `src/` — never absolute `src/...` paths. Inside `ui-component-kit/`, stay package-internal (do not `../../ui-component-kit/...`). See `.cursor/rules/relative-imports.mdc`.
